      "id": "e45f5c35-7219-50ee-bb4d-df98d6cac821",
      "name": "Sticky Note \u2014 Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 340,
        "content": "## \u26a1 Xiaohongshu (RedNote) Comments & Customer Sentiment Scraper \u2014 Automated n8n Pipeline\n**Powered by [UnitBytes on Apify](https://apify.com/unitbytes/xiaohongshu-rednote-comments-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_template)** ($0.00249 / item)\n\n### \ud83d\ude80 30-Second Setup Instructions\n1. **Get your free Apify API Token**: Open [xiaohongshu-rednote-comments-scraper on Apify Store](https://apify.com/unitbytes/xiaohongshu-rednote-comments-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_template) and copy your API token from **Settings \u2192 Integrations**.\n2. **Paste your token & search parameters**: Double-click the **\"1. Set Apify Token & Input\"** node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. **Click \"Test Workflow\"**: The HTTP Request node calls the synchronous UnitBytes Apify endpoint, normalizes the extracted records, and exports a clean CSV file ready for Google Sheets, Airtable, Slack, or OpenAI.\n\n\ud83d\udcd6 **Documentation & Schema Reference**: [https://unitbytes.com/actors/xiaohongshu-comments-scraper/](https://unitbytes.com/actors/xiaohongshu-comments-scraper/)"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e00aa7ac-ffda-5da9-ade9-62ba83e74c0e",
      "name": "Sticky Note \u2014 Destinations",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        880,
        140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 420,
        "height": 220,
        "content": "### \ud83d\udcca Connect Your Destination\nThe **\"3. Normalize Output Fields\"** node outputs flat records (`id, noteId, noteUrl, content, likeCount`).\n\n- **Google Sheets / Airtable**: Connect a Google Sheets (`Append or Update Row`) node after Step 3.\n- **Slack / Telegram / Email Alerts**: Connect a Filter node + Slack node to alert your team on new deals or reviews.\n- **AI Agent / OpenAI**: Connect an OpenAI / LLM Chain node to summarize or classify extracted items."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
